  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant-support peace develop function-UNRCO Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Country Team in Zambia under the leadership of the Resident Coordinator (RC) identified the continued presence of the Peace and Development Advisor (PDA) as important ahead of the 2026 elections. Since 2022, the PDA has provided strategic support for early warning, dialogue facilitation, and consensus-building helping the UN deliver integrated, context sensitive responses to rising political and social tensions. The RC is well placed to ensure adherence to multilateral norms around elections.</narrative>
  </description>
